## N0400 -- grad of a function outside the differentiable fragment (a division).
## command: lume build   (this file shows the diagnostic: the gate runs a copy named .src; N0400_autodiff_division.fixed.src is the corrected program)
## fix: use +, -, * and the listed functions
fn non_poly_div(x: int) -> int = (x * x) / 2
print grad(non_poly_div, 4)
